{"id":"00924","root":"uni00924_1","name":{"ja":"眞田　焔","en":"Sanada Homura"},"title":{"ja":"【バジリスク】","en":"【Basilik】"},"displayName":{"ja":"【バジリスク】 眞田　焔","en":"【Basilik】 Sanada Homura"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2025-07-31","limited":true,"characterId":999,"profile":{"ja":"対魔忍として、長らく任務に就いていた女性。\nその実力は折り紙つきだが、非常に血の気が多く、闘う事しか考えていない戦闘狂。\nひとたび任務から里に戻ると、教師だろうが生徒だろうがお構い無しに特訓と称してボコっているため、一部からは恐れられている。\n実はちゃんと実力を認めている相手を選んでいるため、それを知っている者は止める事はしない。\n戦闘スタイルは、長槍術に火遁を織り交ぜたもの。\n槍の柄を爆発させてロケットのように突っ込み、触れる者を焼き払うという豪快な戦闘をする。\nそのため任務では陽動役を命じられる事が多く、彼女が超火力を振り回す間に、他の対魔忍が要人を暗殺するといった作戦が取られることが多い。\n本人は好き勝手に暴れる事ができて満足している。","en":"She is a Taimanin who has long served on missions. Her skill is unquestionable, but she's hot-blooded and a battle-mad who thinks only of fighting. When she returns to the village, she beats anyone—teacher or student—under the pretext of training, earning fear from some. In reality she only chooses opponents she respects, and those who know this don't try to stop her. Her combat style mixes long-spear techniques with fire ninjutsu, igniting the spear's shaft to thrust like a rocket and incinerate anything it touches. Because of her overwhelming firepower, she's often used as a diversion while other Taimanin assassinate key targets. She's satisfied simply by running wild."},"illustrator":"のぶしと","voiceActor":"疾風はる","forms":[{"id":"uni00924_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[884,1768],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[155,310],"def":[103,206],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","2530117"]},{"id":"uni00924_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1368,2736],"sp":[240,240],"atk":[260,520],"def":[156,312],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","2530117","2530118"]},{"id":"uni00924_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1852,3704],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[365,730],"def":[209,418],"spd":[77,77],"luck":[1,80]},"s